ency and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8jgw2i505vIQ7kNvwEdHfBE&_nc_oc=Adqyswz9meVYyXeEcKG6JvFgbXnm1lV-3o_vgStE1wFdlSX1n-V1cyKIWL5RKauMpqk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfysEvtLU89gp1YHSCBbWF75xfXLaZUpVVZNz1sgofhf2A&oe=69C686B9"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=magy4Afld44Q7kNvwGFXdfE&_nc_oc=AdqMrfLJp14d2hToZ5jC7AhGZ_HNvfqyBnklTmr-Ecg03Ib5FNPwCSp6BmhD3qAnptI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwW87qTPLgRHlOORPLl-dgW-hWPGzXe5Zh6vTCxX_b60A&oe=69C6750F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v3PGPD0j_64Q7kNvwE9clLX&_nc_oc=AdoJFhg_-OwvgQGDneR5_vOYIdJzj8IlQVVaO1lT1CBoT2Se5ay0KT_cR61E-y_Vwig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyuD6kFXegbjvEjFQ29Ku6Pm_weDuWvX0-MeIneJEeNrw&oe=69C682EE"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squa